 "_about": "OoT Randomizer names its places and items by the N64 game's English terms; the remake renamed some. 'replace': OoTR's English hint wording -> the remake's own English names, read from the game's text (LocationMsg/Location.msbt place names, ActorMsg/PouchContent.msbt <actor>_Name item names), applied to every hint the plugin writes (Gossip Stones included). Names OoTR and the remake share are left out. 'areas': OoTR hint area -> the remake's LocationMsg label, and 'rewards': dungeon reward -> remake item actor, for the localized list on the Temple of Time altar (every language reads its own names from data/rando/hints_messages.json). OoTR's ROOT area (a starting item) has no remake place name.",
